MECHANICS IDEAS
	Auction (agent) card should have up to 3 abilities (and be represented as an "agent"): 1 passive, 1 map, 1 battle (+ combat strength)
		Some agent cards may not have a battle or passive ability, but all should have a map ability and a combat strength.
		Stronger abilities should ideally be offset by weaker combat strength, or have higher cost (money, influence, discard, even sacrificing another agent card).
		Map abilities could be a simple keyword (or a combination of keywords): move, attack, construct, move + attack, etc.
		How and when should the passive agent ability be activated?
	Ability to somehow convert money to influence???

