		Supports adjacent sector multiple times (without discarding).
		Supports all sectors (not impacted by adjacency) but discards after use.
		Gain 1 money for each manpower token in the active sector, counting all players.
		Extract the active sector and all adjacent sectors.
		Destroy a building in the active sector and place a manpower token.
		Select an operation token in the active or adjacent sector. Pay to move it to an adjacent sector.
		Move any number of manpower tokens in the active sector to any number of sectors with your manpower tokens.
